<title>INDIA: Yield on 91-day t-bill falls to 6.85 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on 91-day t-bill falls to 6.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it raised the cut-off price to 98.32 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills from 98.29.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield fell to 6.85 percent from 6.98.  </p>
<p>--</p>
